## 🚀 Execution and Verification

### Test Execution Commands

```bash
# Run all tests
pytest

# Run unit tests only
pytest -m unit

# Run integration tests only
pytest -m integration

# Run specific file tests
pytest test/unit/test_data_processor.py

# Run specific class tests
pytest test/unit/test_data_processor.py::TestDataProcessor

# Run specific method tests
pytest test/unit/test_data_processor.py::TestDataProcessor::test_process_valid_data_success

# Run with coverage
pytest --cov=src --cov-report=html

# Run in parallel
pytest -n auto
```

